    "tabs": {
      "type": "section-accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "acordion-0": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is marble safe for dogs?",
            "text": "<p>Natural marble stone is safe for dog use. It is non-toxic and non-porous, which helps reduce bacterial growth. It's also more sturdy and chew-resistant. </p>"
          }
        },
        "acordion-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where is the marble from?",
            "text": "<p>New York Marble, or sometimes referred to as Milas Lilac Marble, is sourced from the Milas in the southern coastal region of Turkey near Bodrum.<br/>Known for its white background and distinctive lilac-purple veining, this marble is a premium choice for high-end interiors and design.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_LYnbeK": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "When will my order ship?",
            "text": "<p>Enjoy Free Standard Delivery.</p><p>Orders are dispatched next day from our Sydney warehouse, unless weekend or holidays.<br/><br/>Shipping takes between 3 - 7 days, depending on your location.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acordion-2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is included in the Marble Dog Bowl Set?",
            "text": "<p>Two generously sized marble bowls and a large marble marble tray. Non-slip base. </p>"
          }
        },
        "d0defd0d-94c3-403c-bd36-dc2f140a104f": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the capacity of each dog bowl?",
            "text": "<p>Each bowl has a 900ML capacity, which is suitable for both small and large dogs and cats.<br/><br/>Use one for food and one for water. </p>"
          }
        },
        "text_zi8YL4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Warranty and returns",
            "text": "<p><strong>Returns</strong><br/>The Marble Bowl Tray Set is a limited edition piece and sale is final. It cannot be returned for change of mind.<br/><br/><strong>Warranty<br/></strong>Warranty is offered for manufacturing defects including faulty workmanship or materials. This warranty does not cover normal wear and tear or damages caused by the customer or by dog use, such as excessive scratching, biting, accidents, chewing, or other use.</p><p>For warranty issues, please contact us within 48 hours of opening the bed at <a>hello@koozipets.com.au</a>, including images of the defective or damaged item. Failure to provide this information within the specified timeframe may void your exchange or refund.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
